      "narration": "The truss we started with takes another approach: straight members joined into triangles. Each member is mainly pulled or pushed along its length, in tension or in compression. Each span here is a simple span, so under a downward load its top chord is squeezed and its bottom chord is stretched. Inside, some web members are in compression and others are in tension.",
